                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                        "entry_id": "805a00bf-c78d-32f8-95bf-283417331b15",
                        "glosses": [
                            "крепкий спиртной напиток, получаемый в результате перегонки виноградных вин и длительного выдерживания в дубовых бочках"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55a6a230-b22b-4ad8-9dee-3409823d1a4c",
                                "sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                                "text": "― Сперва шампанское да венгерское, потом сладенькие ликёрцы, а потом дело дошло и до коньяка…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "95f7549e-fff6-43b8-bd6b-de15ba3c4111",
                                "sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                                "text": "И в то время, когда все засуетились, он медленно достал новую сигару, нащупал в кармане спички и налил себе в стакан коньяку."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "09611b86-2c20-44d3-80c3-360e8dd5ef13",
                        "source_entry_id": "805a00bf-c78d-32f8-95bf-283417331b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                        "target_lang_word": "cognac",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cognac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "225522ef-9e3d-33d5-8f07-dd1e64190cc1",
                                        "entry_id": "503d502a-6d2a-3789-bcf0-0677b625004a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brandy distilled from white wine in the region around Cognac in France."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f49dfe20-d183-460d-942d-539c7217af0d",
                                                "sense_id": "225522ef-9e3d-33d5-8f07-dd1e64190cc1",
                                                "text": "Major manufacturers add a small proportion of caramel to color their cognacs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffb5dbbe-9b15-4e53-80d5-bd7532453288",
                                                "sense_id": "225522ef-9e3d-33d5-8f07-dd1e64190cc1",
                                                "text": "Cognac, with the addition of a little paprika and the yolk of an egg, is considered an effective aphrodisiac aid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c226d187-adfe-4d32-8c3f-0213e760852f",
                                                "sense_id": "225522ef-9e3d-33d5-8f07-dd1e64190cc1",
                                                "text": "We’d have a script meeting for the next day’s shooting that lasted until two in the morning, and he’d be up again at six for a breakfast meeting. I survived on cognac. I have no idea how he did it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c42fb648-2602-4afc-9645-0cb69de2cb71",
                                                "sense_id": "225522ef-9e3d-33d5-8f07-dd1e64190cc1",
                                                "text": "David Mason, Beverage and Bar Manager at St. Regis, describes the complex aromas and layered palate of the cognac thus: “It’s kind of autumn flavors. Really nutty, almondy – kind of fig, plum, dried fruits. But it finishes off really smoothly but with a little bit of tobacco leaf.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46b3e55b-ed2d-485b-9201-a00136a3de5d",
                        "source_entry_id": "805a00bf-c78d-32f8-95bf-283417331b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                        "target_lang_word": "coñac",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coñac",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43a3f591-2eb5-34bf-af7c-241d167a89a5",
                                        "entry_id": "55c14d79-1d53-356e-9fd8-e7fe9e7b57f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bebida alcohólica de alta graduación fabricada por la destilación de vinos flojos y envejecida en barriles de roble."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Bebidas"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c15b159-a2dc-4448-86a6-5ebb70d59817",
                                                "sense_id": "43a3f591-2eb5-34bf-af7c-241d167a89a5",
                                                "text": "Las proporciones de los nutrientes del coñac pueden variar según el tipo y la cantidad de la bebida."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98f17e51-6433-4677-a3dd-c641fc489507",
                        "source_entry_id": "805a00bf-c78d-32f8-95bf-283417331b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                        "target_lang_word": "cognac",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b814c7f-87f0-4804-8143-91f0dc172163",
                        "source_entry_id": "805a00bf-c78d-32f8-95bf-283417331b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb67aa3b-0899-377d-bba5-936e74213d49",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kognak",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kognak",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e51c4f5-a3e9-3fd7-8294-e6012130b703",
                                        "entry_id": "930627fa-5950-346c-8ddc-985472941f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein aus Wein destilliertes alkoholisches Getränk"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d4cfc0a-070e-40e6-bf47-8b565a5e6eeb",
                                                "sense_id": "2e51c4f5-a3e9-3fd7-8294-e6012130b703",
                                                "text": "Frankreich ist für seine außerordentlichen Kognaks bekannt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ce996e9-8890-4114-bfa4-89bd114e30aa",
                                                "sense_id": "2e51c4f5-a3e9-3fd7-8294-e6012130b703",
                                                "text": "„Er forderte zunächst mit Donnerstimme Kognak und schritt dann, da Bordeaux nicht aufzutreiben war, sogleich zur höchsten Stufe vor.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2494c25-4c72-463f-8a74-78dd6d88e4e8",
                                                "sense_id": "2e51c4f5-a3e9-3fd7-8294-e6012130b703",
                                                "text": "„Ich brachte es fertig, keinen Kognak mehr zu trinken, ging ins Wohnzimmer und schlug das Telefonbuch auf.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f384bbd9-b033-466b-86f2-c06ebafdb89d",
                                                "sense_id": "2e51c4f5-a3e9-3fd7-8294-e6012130b703",
                                                "text": "„Die Konsulin, konfrontiert mit diesem tragischen Sachverhalt, stürzte einen doppelten costaricanischen Kognak todesmutig in die schöne Kehle.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5935a329-3b5e-4e44-9fc9-26500c86ec65",
                        "source_entry_id": "805a00bf-c78d-32f8-95bf-283417331b15",
